      },
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Storage by Tier",
      "description": "Where the bytes are, by what will happen to them: raw telemetry that retention will drop, rollups that outlive it, and an audit trail nothing will ever drop.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
